    {"title":"<brown>Welcome, Synthplayer.<yellow> Please select your species.","main-items":{"menu_id":"species-main","width":3,"height":20,"buttons":[{"x":0,"y":1,"description":"Gnolls are canine-like humanoids. They are unable to specialise in any single skill, but instead gradually become proficient in all skills at once.","hotkey":97,"highlight_colour":1,"tile":[{"t":10452,"tex":5}],"labels":["<lightgrey>a - Gnoll"]},{"x":1,"y":1,"description":"Humans are natural explorers. Discovering new places refreshes and invigorates them. They are otherwise completely average.","hotkey":106,"highlight_colour":1,"tile":[{"t":10453,"tex":5}],"labels":["<lightgrey>j - Human"]},{"x":2,"y":1,"description":"Powerful equine hybrids who trace their ancestry to the four winds themselves, Gale Centaurs are at their strongest while galloping swiftly towards foes.","hotkey":115,"highlight_colour":1,"tile":[{"t":10444,"tex":5}],"labels":["<lightgrey>s - Gale Centaur"]},{"x":0,"y":2,"description":"Minotaurs are large muscular humans with bovine heads. They excel at all forms of close and ranged combat.","hotkey":98,"highlight_colour":1,"tile":[{"t":10457,"tex":5}],"labels":["<lightgrey>b - Minotaur"]},{"x":1,"y":2,"description":"Revenants are skeletal undead who are strong at melee combat and can empower damage-dealing spells by consuming memories they harvest from their victims.","hotkey":107,"highlight_colour":1,"tile":[{"t":10462,"tex":5}],"labels":["<lightgrey>k - Revenant"]},{"x":2,"y":2,"description":"Frail symbionts, Vine Stalkers cannot regain health from potions. Their magical reserves absorb damage, and they pack a magic-restoring bite.","hotkey":116,"highlight_colour":1,"tile":[{"t":10466,"tex":5}],"labels":["<lightgrey>t - Vine Stalker"]},{"x":0,"y":3,"description":"Half fish, half human, Merfolk are citizens of both water and land. They are strong combatants, and adept at using magic to assist in battle.","hotkey":99,"highlight_colour":1,"tile":[{"t":10456,"tex":5}],"labels":["<lightgrey>c - Merfolk"]},{"x":1,"y":3,"description":"Kobolds are attuned to the shadows and can only see or be seen at a close range. They are small and a little fragile, and are talented in most skills.","hotkey":108,"highlight_colour":1,"tile":[{"t":10454,"tex":5}],"labels":["<lightgrey>l - Kobold"]},{"x":2,"y":3,"description":"Formless ghosts who delight in hexing their enemies. They can equip many different hats, gloves, boots, or cloaks at once, but cannot wear body armour.","hotkey":117,"highlight_colour":1,"tile":[{"t":10443,"tex":5}],"labels":["<lightgrey>u - Poltergeist"]},{"x":0,"y":4,"description":"Made of living stone, Gargoyles have a preternatural affinity for earth magic. They have low health, but their stone bodies are incredibly tough.","hotkey":100,"highlight_colour":1,"tile":[{"t":10451,"tex":5}],"labels":["<lightgrey>d - Gargoyle"]},{"x":1,"y":4,"description":"Demonspawn are half human, half demon. They acquire strong demonic mutations as they grow.","hotkey":109,"highlight_colour":1,"tile":[{"t":10447,"tex":5}],"labels":["<lightgrey>m - Demonspawn"]},{"x":2,"y":4,"description":"Demigods refuse to worship any god, but make up for this with divine attributes and high reserves of health and magic.","hotkey":118,"highlight_colour":1,"tile":[{"t":10446,"tex":5}],"labels":["<lightgrey>v - Demigod"]},{"x":0,"y":5,"description":"Mountain Dwarves are strong melee fighters and capable heavy-armoured casters. They can use scrolls to enchant even some artefacts.","hotkey":101,"highlight_colour":1,"tile":[{"t":10455,"tex":5}],"labels":["<lightgrey>e - Mountain Dwarf"]},{"x":1,"y":5,"description":"Djinn are ever-burning spirits. They learn spells automatically as they grow, and cast by drawing down their own fires.","hotkey":110,"highlight_colour":1,"tile":[{"t":10467,"tex":5}],"labels":["<lightgrey>n - Djinni"]},{"x":2,"y":5,"description":"Formicids are humanoid ants adept at digging. Their limbs are exceptionally strong and they live in a state of permanent stasis.","hotkey":119,"highlight_colour":1,"tile":[{"t":10449,"tex":5}],"labels":["<lightgrey>w - Formicid"]},{"x":0,"y":6,"description":"Draconians are versatile hybrids. They mature when reaching level 7 and develop a colour.","hotkey":102,"highlight_colour":1,"tile":[{"t":10448,"tex":5}],"labels":["<lightgrey>f - Draconian"]},{"x":1,"y":6,"description":"Large, robust, and extremely fond of drinking, Oni make capable brawlers and spellcasters and gain extra benefits from healing potions.","hotkey":111,"highlight_colour":1,"tile":[{"t":10461,"tex":5}],"labels":["<lightgrey>o - Oni"]},{"x":2,"y":6,"description":"Nagas are hybrids: human from the waist up, with a snake-like tail instead of legs. They move very slowly but are naturally resilient.","hotkey":120,"highlight_colour":1,"tile":[{"t":10459,"tex":5}],"labels":["<lightgrey>x - Naga"]},{"x":0,"y":7,"description":"Trolls are monstrous creatures with powerful claws. They regenerate health rapidly.","hotkey":103,"highlight_colour":1,"tile":[{"t":10465,"tex":5}],"labels":["<lightgrey>g - Troll"]},{"x":1,"y":7,"description":"Very small, very frail and very fast, Spriggans are highly competent stabbers and spellcasters.","hotkey":112,"highlight_colour":1,"tile":[{"t":10463,"tex":5}],"labels":["<lightgrey>p - Spriggan"]},{"x":2,"y":7,"description":"Octopodes are a species of amphibious cephalopods. They can wear eight rings, but almost no armour fits them.","hotkey":121,"highlight_colour":1,"tile":[{"t":10460,"tex":5}],"labels":["<lightgrey>y - Octopode"]},{"x":0,"y":8,"description":"Deep Elves have a strong affinity for all kinds of magic, but are very fragile. They regenerate magical power rapidly.","hotkey":104,"highlight_colour":1,"tile":[{"t":10445,"tex":5}],"labels":["<lightgrey>h - Deep Elf"]},{"x":1,"y":8,"description":"Tengu are bird-people who love to fight, both with weapons and spells. They are fragile but agile, and eventually learn to fly.","hotkey":113,"highlight_colour":1,"tile":[{"t":10464,"tex":5}],"labels":["<lightgrey>q - Tengu"]},{"x":2,"y":8,"description":"Felids are many-lived sentient cats. They cannot use armour or weapons.","hotkey":122,"highlight_colour":1,"tile":[{"t":10442,"tex":5}],"labels":["<lightgrey>z - Felid"]},{"x":0,"y":9,"description":"Barachim are slow-moving, amphibious humanoids who can hop long distances. Their extended range of vision also allows them to be seen from further away.","hotkey":105,"highlight_colour":1,"tile":[{"t":10450,"tex":5}],"labels":["<lightgrey>i - Barachi"]},{"x":1,"y":9,"description":"Coglins ride enchanted exoskeletons able to wield weapons in both hands, wrapping slow-revving metal around their puny goblinoid frames.","hotkey":114,"highlight_colour":1,"tile":[{"t":10469,"tex":5}],"labels":["<lightgrey>r - Coglin"]},{"x":2,"y":9,"description":"Compelled to walk by an ancient curse, Mummies have innate faith and are adept at Necromancy, but learn other skills very slowly. They cannot drink potions.","hotkey":65,"highlight_colour":1,"tile":[{"t":10458,"tex":5}],"labels":["<lightgrey>A - Mummy"]}],"labels":[{"x":0,"y":0,"label":"<lightblue>Simple"},{"x":1,"y":0,"label":"<lightblue>Intermediate"},{"x":2,"y":0,"label":"<lightblue>Advanced"}]},"sub-items":{"menu_id":"species-sub","width":2,"height":4,"buttons":[{"x":0,"y":0,"description":"Picks a random recommended background based on your current species choice.","hotkey":43,"highlight_colour":1,"label":"<brown>+ - Recommended species"},{"x":1,"y":0,"description":"Picks a random species.","hotkey":42,"highlight_colour":1,"label":"<brown>    * - Random species"},{"x":0,"y":1,"description":"Shuffles through random recommended character combinations until you accept one.","hotkey":35,"highlight_colour":1,"label":"<brown># - Recommended character"},{"x":1,"y":1,"description":"Shuffles through random character combinations until you accept one.","hotkey":33,"highlight_colour":1,"label":"<brown>    ! - Random character"},{"x":0,"y":2,"description":"Lists the numerical skill train aptitudes for all races.","hotkey":37,"highlight_colour":1,"label":"<brown>% - List aptitudes"},{"x":1,"y":2,"description":"Lets you pick your background first.","hotkey":32,"highlight_colour":1,"label":"<brown>Space - Pick background first"},{"x":0,"y":3,"description":"Opens the help screen.","hotkey":63,"highlight_colour":1,"label":"<brown>? - Help"},{"x":1,"y":3,"description":"Play a new game with your previous choice.","hotkey":9,"highlight_colour":1,"label":"<brown>  Tab - Gnoll Forgewright"}],"labels":[]},"msg":"ui-push","type":"newgame-choice","ui-centred":true,"generation_id":1},
